  "summary": "In 9 CE Germanic warriors under the Cheruscan leader Arminius defeated three Roman legions led by Publius Quinctilius Varus. The defeat halted Roman efforts to turn Germania into a province; Rome later gave up its aggressive Germania policy. The Kalkriese site is the usual candidate for the battlefield, though a museum research project notes the identification is disputed.",
